---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { DISCLAIMER, SITE } from '../lib/site';
---

<Base title="Disclaimer" description="MastersVault is independent and not affiliated with any test maker.">
  <div class="container page prose">
    <h1>Disclaimer</h1>
    <p class="notice">{DISCLAIMER}</p>

    <h2>No affiliation</h2>
    <p>
      {SITE.name} is an independent educational project. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, sponsored by or
      otherwise connected to the Graduate Management Admission Council (GMAC), Pearson VUE or any other organisation
      that writes, owns or administers an admissions test. Exam names appear on this site only to describe what the
      practice material is for.
    </p>

    <h2>Original content</h2>
    <p>
      All questions, passages, explanations and revision notes are original works written for {SITE.name}. None are
      official test questions.
    </p>

    <h2>The test screen</h2>
    <p>
      The test screen copies the <em>format and rules</em> of the exam (section timing, question types, navigation and
      review) so that practice feels realistic. It doesn't reproduce any official software, branding or design.
    </p>

    <h2>Scores</h2>
    <p>
      Scores shown after a mock or practice set are rough, unofficial estimates based on the questions you answered
      here. They don't predict your official score, and you shouldn't use them in any application.
    </p>

    <h2>No warranty</h2>
    <p>
      The material is provided as is. We work hard to keep it accurate, but mistakes can happen, and you can report
      them on <a href={SITE.repo}>GitHub</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
